comments.body:
@reporter or anyone involved in this issue, do you have any updates on that problem?
I came here as I observed basically the same problem on my side - I am training a very simple network on A100 GPU, consisting of fully connected, batchnorm and relu blocks. I am compiling the model only for final evaluation on the test set (training always goes well), and if I use any other method of compilation than `max-autotune-no-cudagraphs` my test RMSE goes though the roof (it is around 5.7 vs 1.7-2 if compiling without cudagraphs`). I did not experiment extensively with the inductor config.
I can also show some steps to reproduce if needed.
